{"unit_id":"phos9herus__dsh-pixel-appearance#feature-1","repo":"phos9herus/dsh-pixel-appearance","commit":"48c44cf030253e60b3b41c0100aa59df08e962f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pixel Appearance 的功能「循环像素背景」：在像素主题下绘制涟漪、雨、极光或脉冲动画。用户在外观设置中选择主题与动画，画布持续显示对应像素效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/10-engine.js:1"]}
