{"unit_id":"phos9herus__dsh-pixel-appearance#feature-3","repo":"phos9herus/dsh-pixel-appearance","commit":"48c44cf030253e60b3b41c0100aa59df08e962f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pixel Appearance 的功能「会话回顾主题」：回顾主题读取当前聊天内容或最近会话样本，判断代码、调查、创作、讨论类别并呈现对应动画；设置页也可手动锁定类别。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/47-review.js:1680-1710"]}
{"unit_id":"phos9herus__dsh-pixel-appearance#feature-4","repo":"phos9herus/dsh-pixel-appearance","commit":"48c44cf030253e60b3b41c0100aa59df08e962f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pixel Appearance 的功能「材质与配色」：用户可调整主体色、背景色、像素渐变、画布材质，以及输入卡和侧栏的颜色、透明度与模糊半径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:7-43"]}
